  - id: FK_P09_07_N2
    speaker: "Del Cruz"
    line: "When you describe it, keep one thing back."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: de1a4b5c6d7e8f90a1b2c3d4e5f6a701, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P09_07_N3
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P09_07_N3
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "Which thing? I asked why. Del didn't say. Just asked again."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ae0c3985c1991244d8ee72fa0756eb08, type: 3}
    emotion: 6
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P09_07_N4
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P09_07_N4
    speaker: "Del Cruz"
    line: "Your pick. Choose one detail, don't say it on air, and tell me what it was. That's all I'm asking."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: de1a4b5c6d7e8f90a1b2c3d4e5f6a701, type: 3}
